      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agent Skills are a lightweight, open format for extending\n AI capabilities.\n\nA skill is a folder of organized files consisting of  \n    instructions, \n    scripts, \n    assets,\n    resources\nthat agents can discover to perform a specific task accurately.",
